# LaunchPolicy Log Predicate

Approx. line 148

```bash
LOG_PREDICATE='subsystem == "com.apple.devicemanagementclient.managedeventsd" AND category == "LaunchPolicy" AND eventMessage CONTAINS[c] "DENIED"'
```

Purpose:

Filters logs to only LaunchPolicy DENIED events.

