# Watchdog Behaviour

The watchdog executes every:

```text
60 seconds
```

Functions:

* Verifies file existence
* Corrects ownership
* Corrects permissions
* Validates notifier LaunchDaemon
* Reloads notifier if required
* Reapplies immutable flags

---

# Immutable Protection

Applied after successful deployment:

```bash
chflags uchg
```

Protected items:

* Notifier script
* Notifier LaunchDaemon
* Watchdog script
* Watchdog LaunchDaemon

This provides additional resistance against local modification or deletion.

